---
# NotArc is Objective-C++ on top of CEF/Chromium; base the style on Chromium's
# own .clang-format (2-space indent, pointer-left alignment) but raise the
# column limit to match code already written at ~100-130 columns, so this
# first pass doesn't rewrap most of the existing tree.
BasedOnStyle: Chromium
ColumnLimit: 120
SortIncludes: false
AllowShortIfStatementsOnASingleLine: WithoutElse
AllowShortBlocksOnASingleLine: Always
AllowShortLoopsOnASingleLine: true
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: All
AllowShortCaseLabelsOnASingleLine: true
